<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<script src="./support.js"></script>
<template id="__bundler_thumbnail" data-bg-color="#1D2F41">
  <svg viewBox="0 0 1200 800" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
    <rect width="1200" height="800" fill="#1D2F41"/>
    <circle cx="1010" cy="150" r="240" fill="#4AA6B3" opacity="0.22"/>
    <text x="150" y="430" font-family="Archivo, system-ui, sans-serif" font-size="190" font-weight="900" fill="#ffffff" letter-spacing="-6">éx<tspan fill="#4AA6B3">es</tspan></text>
    <rect x="152" y="490" width="330" height="14" fill="#4AA6B3"/>
    <text x="152" y="590" font-family="Archivo, system-ui, sans-serif" font-size="58" font-weight="700" fill="#B2B3B4">EXES11</text>
  </svg>
</template>
</head>
<body>
<x-dc>
<helmet>
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link rel="stylesheet" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Archivo:wght@400;500;600;700;800;900&display=swap">
<link rel="stylesheet" href="_ds/modernist-7d073ac9-bb26-424b-a4e5-4846d57d44c5/styles.css">
<script src="_ds/modernist-7d073ac9-bb26-424b-a4e5-4846d57d44c5/_ds_bundle.js"></script>
<script src="./image-slot.js"></script>
<style>
  body { margin: 0; background: #F3F2F2; overflow-x: hidden; }
  a { color: #1D2F41; }
  a:hover { color: #4AA6B3; }
  @keyframes exesFloat { 0%, 100% { transform: translateY(0); } 50% { transform: translateY(-10px); } }
  @keyframes exesMarquee { from { transform: translateX(0); } to { transform: translateX(-50%); } }
  [data-r="burger"] { display: none; }
  @media (max-width: 1023px) {
    [data-r="navlinks"] { display: none !important; }
    [data-r="burger"] { display: inline-flex !important; }
    [data-r="navcta"] { margin-left: auto; }
  }
  @media (max-width: 860px) {
    [data-r="herophoto"] { min-height: 320px !important; }
    [data-r="chart"] text { font-size: 17px; }
    [data-r="chart"] text[data-r="chartnote"] { font-size: 15px; }
  }
  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    [data-r="navcta"] { padding: 11px 15px !important; font-size: 12.5px !important; }
    [data-r="navcta"] svg { display: none !important; }
    [data-r="fc1"], [data-r="fc2"] { max-width: 66% !important; padding: 11px 14px !important; }
    [data-r="fc1"] { left: 0 !important; top: 6% !important; }
    [data-r="fc2"] { right: 0 !important; bottom: 30% !important; }
    [data-r="fc3"] { display: none !important; }
    [data-r="chart"] text { font-size: 20px; }
    [data-r="chart"] text[data-r="chartnote"] { font-size: 16px; }
  }
  @media (max-width: 420px) {
    [data-r="herophoto"] { min-height: 260px !important; }
    [data-r="fc1"], [data-r="fc2"] { max-width: 78% !important; }
  }

</style>
</helmet>

<div style="--exes-accent: {{ accent }}; font-family: Archivo, system-ui, sans-serif; color: #1D2F41; background: #F3F2F2; width: 100%; max-width: 100%; padding-bottom: 1px;">

  <svg width="0" height="0" style="position: absolute; pointer-events: none;" aria-hidden="true">
    <defs>
      <filter id="exesLiquid" x="-25%" y="-25%" width="150%" height="150%" color-interpolation-filters="sRGB">
        <feTurbulence type="fractalNoise" baseFrequency="0.007 0.013" numOctaves="2" seed="7" result="n"></feTurbulence>
        <feGaussianBlur in="n" stdDeviation="2.4" result="sn"></feGaussianBlur>
        <feDisplacementMap in="SourceGraphic" in2="sn" scale="24" xChannelSelector="R" yChannelSelector="G"></feDisplacementMap>
      </filter>
      <filter id="exesLiquidR" x="-25%" y="-25%" width="150%" height="150%" color-interpolation-filters="sRGB">
        <feTurbulence type="fractalNoise" baseFrequency="0.007 0.013" numOctaves="2" seed="7" result="n"></feTurbulence>
        <feGaussianBlur in="n" stdDeviation="2.4" result="sn"></feGaussianBlur>
        <feDisplacementMap in="SourceGraphic" in2="sn" scale="36" xChannelSelector="R" yChannelSelector="G"></feDisplacementMap>
      </filter>
      <filter id="exesLiquidB" x="-25%" y="-25%" width="150%" height="150%" color-interpolation-filters="sRGB">
        <feTurbulence type="fractalNoise" baseFrequency="0.007 0.013" numOctaves="2" seed="7" result="n"></feTurbulence>
        <feGaussianBlur in="n" stdDeviation="2.4" result="sn"></feGaussianBlur>
        <feDisplacementMap in="SourceGraphic" in2="sn" scale="34" xChannelSelector="R" yChannelSelector="G"></feDisplacementMap>
      </filter>
    </defs>
  </svg>

  <div style="position: sticky; top: 12px; z-index: 40; padding: 12px clamp(12px, 3vw, 28px) 0;">
    <nav style="position: relative; max-width: 1240px; margin: 0 auto; background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.60), rgba(255,255,255,0.30) 46%, rgba(74,166,179,0.14)); backdrop-filter: blur(20px) saturate(180%) brightness(1.06); -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(20px) saturate(180%) brightness(1.06); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.65); border-radius: 999px; box-shadow: inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,0.92), inset 0 -1px 2px rgba(255,255,255,0.45), inset 0 0 22px rgba(255,255,255,0.30), 0 14px 38px rgba(29,47,65,0.16), 0 2px 6px rgba(29,47,65,0.08); display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 12px; padding: 10px 12px 10px 22px; isolation: isolate; overflow: hidden; transition: transform 260ms cubic-bezier(0.2, 0.9, 0.25, 1), box-shadow 260ms ease;" onMouseMove="{{ onGlassMove }}" onMouseLeave="{{ onGlassLeave }}" style-hover="transform: scale(1.008);" style-before="content: ''; position: absolute; inset: 0; border-radius: 999px; padding: 1px; background: linear-gradient(120deg, rgba(255,255,255,0.95), rgba(255,255,255,0) 34%, rgba(255,255,255,0) 66%, rgba(255,255,255,0.7)); -webkit-mask: linear-gradient(#000 0 0) content-box, linear-gradient(#000 0 0); -webkit-mask-composite: xor; mask: linear-gradient(#000 0 0) content-box, linear-gradient(#000 0 0); mask-composite: exclude; pointer-events: none; z-index: 2;" style-after="content: ''; position: absolute; left: 6%; right: 6%; top: 2px; height: 42%; border-radius: 999px; background: linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(255,255,255,0.55), rgba(255,255,255,0)); pointer-events: none; z-index: 1;">
      <div style="position: absolute; inset: 0; border-radius: 999px; pointer-events: none; backdrop-filter: blur(2px) url(#exesLiquid) saturate(140%); -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(2px) saturate(140%); z-index: 0;"></div>
      <div style="{{ glassSheen }}"></div>

      <a href="#topo" style="display: flex; align-items: center; text-decoration: none; flex-shrink: 0; position: relative; z-index: 3;" aria-label="Éxes">
        <svg width="104" height="33" viewBox="0 0 112 35" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
          <path d="M14.8794 8.69299C18.671 8.39067 23.2091 9.5547 25.3804 12.8727C27.1265 15.5411 27.3076 19.4559 26.687 22.4733C24.3067 22.521 21.7889 22.481 19.3999 22.4811H5.46826C5.65109 27.2159 8.88239 29.6039 13.3901 29.6061C15.7172 29.6071 17.9606 29.1212 19.7505 27.5221C20.7285 26.6483 21.1005 25.3851 22.6157 25.5104C23.0691 25.5348 23.638 25.5125 24.105 25.5172C24.8915 25.515 25.6779 25.5186 26.4644 25.5289C24.8106 30.7541 20.6624 33.4226 15.3013 33.9381C11.1801 34.3342 6.64124 33.719 3.41748 30.8864C1.40536 29.1344 0.184968 26.6449 0.0317364 23.9811C-0.419057 16.782 3.96757 10.9364 10.9575 9.22522C12.3665 8.88027 13.4237 8.78416 14.8794 8.69299ZM16.3071 13.1393C15.7535 13.066 14.9307 13.0337 14.3813 13.1002C11.6587 13.277 9.64894 14.0814 7.75928 16.151C7.10952 16.8627 6.45397 17.9691 6.17431 18.8824L13.5815 18.8854H21.6245C21.5865 15.5368 19.684 13.5869 16.3071 13.1393Z" fill="#1D2F41"></path>
          <path d="M75.1613 8.69242C76.1678 8.65495 77.176 8.69245 78.177 8.80278C83.4284 9.35247 86.8994 12.5518 87.2141 17.8623C87.3132 19.5378 87.1651 20.8011 86.9895 22.4678C84.867 22.5276 82.5478 22.4816 80.4143 22.4815L65.757 22.4883C65.8478 27.2775 69.2794 29.624 73.7297 29.6036C76.9853 29.5885 79.4045 28.6668 81.4309 25.962C81.8857 25.3555 83.6777 25.5104 84.4113 25.5176L86.6984 25.5205C86.2913 27.1083 85.513 28.5765 84.427 29.8038C79.7326 35.1671 68.9736 35.4431 63.6701 30.876C58.6992 26.5953 59.5526 18.3098 63.6291 13.7305C66.7697 10.2024 70.5931 8.98185 75.1613 8.69242ZM74.9231 13.0801C74.8289 13.0829 74.7343 13.0898 74.6408 13.1006C70.6597 13.3645 67.9626 15.1941 66.4113 18.8809L73.759 18.8858L81.8723 18.8868C81.8276 17.2173 81.6184 16.0133 80.3342 14.7911C78.832 13.3616 76.9144 13.0277 74.9231 13.0801Z" fill="#1D2F41"></path>
          <path d="M54.6722 8.69193C54.9603 8.6457 55.4049 8.70277 55.7033 8.72322C57.713 8.86067 59.7847 10.5579 59.5367 12.7416C59.4363 13.6111 58.9962 14.4058 58.3136 14.9531C56.9655 16.0224 54.7172 16.0445 53.4912 14.7684C53.3279 14.5983 53.1662 14.3903 53.0199 14.205C50.7149 15.9408 49.1456 18.4739 47.4339 20.8203C47.7002 21.4926 48.0337 22.1961 48.3277 22.8561C49.0586 24.4971 49.7965 26.2046 50.5622 27.821C50.7913 28.3049 51.4562 29.5592 51.9147 29.6478C53.1836 29.8931 54.2314 26.5014 54.4422 25.789C55.1087 26.0413 56.9808 26.3119 57.2165 26.9722C57.4712 27.6856 56.7396 29.2496 56.4219 29.9399C55.7093 31.4872 54.5038 33.0071 52.8392 33.5638C51.5409 33.9978 49.822 33.9533 48.58 33.3425C46.442 32.2912 45.5213 29.9024 44.6985 27.8218C44.3831 27.0243 44.013 26.1881 43.732 25.3858C41.7032 28.0102 40.6354 30.4807 37.7204 32.4905C35.4037 34.1012 31.192 34.6535 29.341 32.0956C28.8064 31.3612 28.5923 30.4413 28.7478 29.5463C29.1206 27.312 31.9176 26.0874 33.8608 27.1794C34.4882 27.5319 34.8096 27.8847 35.2195 28.4652C37.2061 27.2812 39.9235 23.288 41.4001 21.3053C40.2881 18.8 39.2341 16.0863 38.0801 13.6251L32.8161 13.6239C33.2859 12.1721 33.5484 10.3867 34.2356 9.06113C34.4727 8.60382 36.9184 8.72236 37.4299 8.72273L42.0153 8.72622C42.8802 10.8592 43.65 13.0448 44.5019 15.1843C44.71 15.7068 44.8838 16.2221 45.1375 16.727C47.4254 13.1916 50.1084 9.11439 54.6722 8.69193Z" fill="#4AA6B3"></path>
          <path d="M102.546 8.69331C102.953 8.67286 103.36 8.67078 103.766 8.68725C106.153 8.77119 108.64 9.28225 110.321 11.1214C111.899 12.8477 112.062 14.6544 111.984 16.8301C110.808 16.8354 109.61 16.8629 108.428 16.8447C106.751 16.8572 107.093 15.1193 106.209 14.2264C104.591 12.5907 100.327 12.8448 98.6691 14.3001C97.6932 15.1566 97.3718 17.1232 98.6397 17.8798C102.975 20.4684 113.076 19.7763 111.654 27.3912C110.56 33.2504 104.43 34.1836 99.5274 34.0063C96.4933 33.7489 93.5162 32.9268 91.6123 30.3291C90.6089 28.9598 90.121 27.2108 90.3891 25.5213C91.2731 25.5148 95.0939 25.2282 95.4024 26.0497C96.6384 29.3379 99.2543 29.7933 102.405 29.6027C104.599 29.4699 106.309 28.4883 106.255 26.0766C106.063 23.7749 101.92 23.56 100.187 23.0353C97.8426 22.3251 95.2151 21.7707 93.4721 19.9306C91.4941 17.8421 92.1259 14.1453 93.9325 12.1699C96.205 9.65763 99.2831 8.91863 102.546 8.69331Z" fill="#1D2F41"></path>
          <path d="M20.1264 0C21.0276 0.0408811 21.7618 0.170835 22.4177 0.854217C22.9034 1.35522 23.1653 2.03168 23.1436 2.72917C23.1235 3.46554 22.8084 4.16304 22.2693 4.66503C20.9663 5.86893 18.7392 5.56262 17.0831 5.50311L12.1581 5.30657L8.74246 5.15724C8.70572 4.8159 8.67193 4.47419 8.64114 4.13224C8.56235 3.18837 8.66752 2.92601 9.61459 2.64963C10.9906 2.30438 12.4257 1.80954 13.8043 1.50591C15.7714 1.07265 18.1334 0.117874 20.1264 0Z" fill="#1D2F41"></path>
        </svg>
      </a>
      <div data-r="navlinks" style="display: flex; flex-wrap: nowrap; align-items: center; justify-content: center; gap: 2px; flex: 1 1 auto; min-width: 0; overflow: hidden; position: relative; z-index: 3;">
        <a href="#tese" style="font-size: 13.5px; font-weight: 600; color: #374D61; text-decoration: none; padding: 9px 12px; border-radius: 999px; white-space: nowrap;" style-hover="background: rgba(74,166,179,0.14); color: #1D2F41;">A tese</a>
        <a href="#numeros" style="font-size: 13.5px; font-weight: 600; color: #374D61; text-decoration: none; padding: 9px 12px; border-radius: 999px; white-space: nowrap;" style-hover="background: rgba(74,166,179,0.14); color: #1D2F41;">Números</a>
        <a href="#projecao" style="font-size: 13.5px; font-weight: 600; color: #374D61; text-decoration: none; padding: 9px 12px; border-radius: 999px; white-space: nowrap;" style-hover="background: rgba(74,166,179,0.14); color: #1D2F41;">Projeção</a>
        <a href="#gestora" style="font-size: 13.5px; font-weight: 600; color: #374D61; text-decoration: none; padding: 9px 12px; border-radius: 999px; white-space: nowrap;" style-hover="background: rgba(74,166,179,0.14); color: #1D2F41;">Gestora</a>
        <a href="#faq" style="font-size: 13.5px; font-weight: 600; color: #374D61; text-decoration: none; padding: 9px 12px; border-radius: 999px; white-space: nowrap;" style-hover="background: rgba(74,166,179,0.14); color: #1D2F41;">Riscos</a>
      </div>
      <button type="button" data-r="burger" onClick="{{ toggleMenu }}" aria-label="Abrir menu" style="align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 42px; height: 42px; border-radius: 999px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.45); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.6); color: #1D2F41; cursor: pointer; flex-shrink: 0; position: relative; z-index: 3; margin-left: auto;" style-hover="background: rgba(255,255,255,0.7);">
        <svg width="19" height="19" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.4" stroke-linecap="round"><path d="M4 7h16"></path><path d="M4 12h16"></path><path d="M4 17h16"></path></svg>
      </button>
      <a href="#" data-r="navcta" style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; background: var(--exes-accent, #4AA6B3); color: #10222f; font-size: 13.5px; font-weight: 800; padding: 12px 20px; border-radius: 999px; text-decoration: none; box-shadow: 0 8px 20px rgba(74,166,179,0.35); flex-shrink: 0; white-space: nowrap; position: relative; z-index: 3;" style-hover="background: #3d8f9b;">{{ ctaLabel }}
        <svg width="15" height="15" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="M13 5l7 7-7 7"></path></svg>
      </a>
    </nav>
    <sc-if value="{{ menuOpen }}" hint-placeholder-val="{{ false }}">
      <div style="max-width: 1240px; margin: 8px auto 0; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.92); backdrop-filter: blur(18px) saturate(160%); -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(18px) saturate(160%); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.65); border-radius: 24px; box-shadow: 0 18px 44px rgba(29,47,65,0.18); padding: 12px; display: grid; gap: 4px;">
        <a href="#tese" onClick="{{ closeMenu }}" style="font-size: 15px; font-weight: 700; color: #1D2F41; text-decoration: none; padding: 14px 16px; border-radius: 16px;" style-hover="background: rgba(74,166,179,0.14);">A tese</a>
        <a href="#numeros" onClick="{{ closeMenu }}" style="font-size: 15px; font-weight: 700; color: #1D2F41; text-decoration: none; padding: 14px 16px; border-radius: 16px;" style-hover="background: rgba(74,166,179,0.14);">Números</a>
        <a href="#projecao" onClick="{{ closeMenu }}" style="font-size: 15px; font-weight: 700; color: #1D2F41; text-decoration: none; padding: 14px 16px; border-radius: 16px;" style-hover="background: rgba(74,166,179,0.14);">Projeção</a>
        <a href="#gestora" onClick="{{ closeMenu }}" style="font-size: 15px; font-weight: 700; color: #1D2F41; text-decoration: none; padding: 14px 16px; border-radius: 16px;" style-hover="background: rgba(74,166,179,0.14);">Gestora</a>
        <a href="#cronograma" onClick="{{ closeMenu }}" style="font-size: 15px; font-weight: 700; color: #1D2F41; text-decoration: none; padding: 14px 16px; border-radius: 16px;" style-hover="background: rgba(74,166,179,0.14);">Cronograma</a>
        <a href="#faq" onClick="{{ closeMenu }}" style="font-size: 15px; font-weight: 700; color: #1D2F41; text-decoration: none; padding: 14px 16px; border-radius: 16px;" style-hover="background: rgba(74,166,179,0.14);">Riscos</a>
        <a href="#documentos" onClick="{{ closeMenu }}" style="font-size: 15px; font-weight: 700; color: #1D2F41; text-decoration: none; padding: 14px 16px; border-radius: 16px;" style-hover="background: rgba(74,166,179,0.14);">Documentos da oferta</a>
      </div>
    </sc-if>
  </div>

  <section id="topo" data-screen-label="01 Hero" style="padding: clamp(16px, 2.5vw, 28px) clamp(12px, 3vw, 28px) 0;">
    <div style="max-width: 1240px; margin: 0 auto; background: #1D2F41; border-radius: clamp(24px, 3vw, 40px); overflow: hidden; color: #ffffff; box-shadow: 0 30px 70px rgba(29,47,65,0.28); position: relative;">
      <div style="position: absolute; top: -140px; right: -120px; width: 460px; height: 460px; border-radius: 999px; background: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(74,166,179,0.30), rgba(74,166,179,0) 70%); pointer-events: none;"></div>

      <div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(320px, 1fr)); gap: clamp(28px, 4vw, 56px); align-items: center; padding: clamp(32px, 5vw, 72px) clamp(24px, 4vw, 60px) 0;">
        <div style="min-width: 0; position: relative;">
          <div style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border: 1px solid rgba(74,166,179,0.45); border-radius: 999px; padding: 8px 16px 8px 12px; margin-bottom: 24px;">
            <span style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 22px; height: 22px; border-radius: 999px; background: var(--exes-accent, #4AA6B3); color: #10222f;">
              <svg width="13" height="13" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M20 6L9 17l-5-5"></path></svg>
            </span>
            <span style="font-size: 12.5px; font-weight: 700; color: #ffffff;">2º lugar entre 87 FIIs de recebíveis · jun/2026</span>
          </div>
          <h1 style="font-size: clamp(34px, 4.4vw, 60px); line-height: 1.04; letter-spacing: -0.03em; font-weight: 900; margin: 0 0 20px; text-wrap: pretty;">Um dos FIIs com maior DY patrimonial da bolsa está em oferta, <span style="color: var(--exes-accent, #4AA6B3);">com desconto</span></h1>
          <p style="font-size: clamp(15.5px, 1.3vw, 18px); line-height: 1.6; color: #B2B3B4; max-width: 48ch; margin: 0 0 30px;">O EXES11 ocupa o 2º lugar em rendimento patrimonial entre 87 fundos de recebíveis, e agora você pode entrar pagando menos do que a cota vale.</p>
          <div style="display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 12px; align-items: center;">
            <a href="#" style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; background: var(--exes-accent, #4AA6B3); color: #10222f; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 800; padding: 17px 26px; border-radius: 999px; text-decoration: none; box-shadow: 0 14px 32px rgba(74,166,179,0.38);" style-hover="background: #3d8f9b;">{{ ctaLabel }}
              <svg width="17" height="17" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12h14"></path><path d="M13 5l7 7-7 7"></path></svg>
            </a>
          </div>
          <p style="font-size: 11px; line-height: 1.6; color: #787D81; margin: 24px 0 0; max-width: 54ch;">A rentabilidade passada não representa garantia de rentabilidade futura. Este documento é um material publicitário e contém apenas um resumo das informações constantes dos documentos da Oferta, com os quais não se confunde.</p>
        </div>

        <div data-r="herophoto" style="position: relative; min-width: 0; min-height: clamp(330px, 40vw, 470px);">
          <div style="position: absolute; inset: 0; border-radius: clamp(20px, 2.4vw, 32px); overflow: hidden; border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.14);">
            <img src="assets/hero.png" alt="" style="width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: cover; object-position: center;">
          </div>
          <div data-r="fc1" style="position: absolute; left: -14px; top: 10%; background: rgba(22,40,58,0.94); backdrop-filter: blur(8px); border: 1px solid rgba(74,166,179,0.45); border-radius: 18px; padding: 14px 18px; max-width: 232px; box-shadow: 0 20px 44px rgba(0,0,0,0.45); animation: exesFloat 7s ease-in-out infinite;">
