  <section id="tese" data-screen-label="02 Tese" style="padding: clamp(48px, 6vw, 90px) clamp(16px, 4vw, 40px) 0;">
    <div style="max-width: 1240px; margin: 0 auto;">
      <div style="max-width: 62ch; margin-bottom: clamp(28px, 3vw, 44px);">
        <span style="display: inline-block; font-size: 11.5px; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: 0.12em; text-transform: uppercase; color: #1D2F41; background: rgba(74,166,179,0.22); border: 1px solid rgba(74,166,179,0.45); border-radius: 999px; padding: 7px 14px; margin-bottom: 18px;">A tese do fundo</span>
        <h2 style="font-size: clamp(28px, 3.4vw, 46px); line-height: 1.06; letter-spacing: -0.03em; font-weight: 900; margin: 0 0 16px; text-wrap: pretty;">Crédito imobiliário estruturado, com garantia real e originação própria</h2>
        <p style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.65; color: #374D61; margin: 0;">O EXES11 investe majoritariamente em crédito imobiliário estruturado (CRIs), com garantias reais e monitoramento independente. A carteira é majoritariamente originada e estruturada pela própria gestora, o que dá mais controle sobre os termos de cada operação.</p>
      </div>

      <div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(250px, 1fr)); gap: 16px;">
        <div style="background: #ffffff; border: 1px solid rgba(29,47,65,0.10); border-radius: 24px; padding: 26px; box-shadow: 0 8px 24px rgba(29,47,65,0.06);">
          <span style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 44px; height: 44px; border-radius: 14px; background: rgba(74,166,179,0.16); color: #1D2F41; margin-bottom: 18px;">
            <svg width="21" height="21" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z"></path></svg>
          </span>
          <h3 style="font-size: 18px; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: -0.01em; margin: 0 0 8px;">Originação própria</h3>
          <p style="font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.55; color: #585858; margin: 0 0 14px;">72% da carteira de crédito é estruturada pela própria Éxes, com controle sobre os termos de cada operação.</p>
          <div style="font-size: 26px; font-weight: 900; letter-spacing: -0.03em; color: var(--exes-accent, #4AA6B3);">72%</div>
        </div>
        <div style="background: #ffffff; border: 1px solid rgba(29,47,65,0.10); border-radius: 24px; padding: 26px; box-shadow: 0 8px 24px rgba(29,47,65,0.06);">
          <span style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 44px; height: 44px; border-radius: 14px; background: rgba(74,166,179,0.16); color: #1D2F41; margin-bottom: 18px;">
            <svg width="21" height="21" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><rect x="3" y="11" width="18" height="10" rx="2"></rect><path d="M7 11V7a5 5 0 0110 0v4"></path></svg>
          </span>
          <h3 style="font-size: 18px; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: -0.01em; margin: 0 0 8px;">Cobertura de garantias</h3>
          <p style="font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.55; color: #585858; margin: 0 0 14px;">LTV médio ponderado das operações com garantia real, conforme o Estudo de Viabilidade.</p>
          <div style="font-size: 26px; font-weight: 900; letter-spacing: -0.03em; color: var(--exes-accent, #4AA6B3);">52%</div>
        </div>
        <div style="background: #ffffff; border: 1px solid rgba(29,47,65,0.10); border-radius: 24px; padding: 26px; box-shadow: 0 8px 24px rgba(29,47,65,0.06);">
          <span style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 44px; height: 44px; border-radius: 14px; background: rgba(74,166,179,0.16); color: #1D2F41; margin-bottom: 18px;">
            <svg width="21" height="21" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M3 3v18h18"></path><path d="M7 15h3v3H7zM12 10h3v8h-3zM17 6h3v12h-3z"></path></svg>
          </span>
          <h3 style="font-size: 18px; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: -0.01em; margin: 0 0 8px;">Distribuição estável</h3>
          <p style="font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.55; color: #585858; margin: 0 0 14px;">19 meses consecutivos de distribuição no mesmo patamar, de R$ 0,13 por cota.</p>
          <div style="font-size: 26px; font-weight: 900; letter-spacing: -0.03em; color: var(--exes-accent, #4AA6B3);">R$ 0,13</div>
        </div>
        <div style="background: #ffffff; border: 1px solid rgba(29,47,65,0.10); border-radius: 24px; padding: 26px; box-shadow: 0 8px 24px rgba(29,47,65,0.06);">
          <span style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 44px; height: 44px; border-radius: 14px; background: rgba(74,166,179,0.16); color: #1D2F41; margin-bottom: 18px;">
            <svg width="21" height="21" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"></circle><path d="M12 7v5l3 2"></path></svg>
          </span>
          <h3 style="font-size: 18px; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: -0.01em; margin: 0 0 8px;">Histórico na bolsa</h3>
          <p style="font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.55; color: #585858; margin: 0 0 14px;">O fundo está prestes a completar cinco anos de negociação na B3.</p>
          <div style="font-size: 26px; font-weight: 900; letter-spacing: -0.03em; color: var(--exes-accent, #4AA6B3);">5 anos</div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <p style="font-size: 11px; line-height: 1.6; color: #787D81; margin: 22px 0 0;">Fonte: Éxes Gestora de Recursos — “A tese de investimento em quatro pilares” e “O EXES11 em números”, data-base 31/07/2026. A rentabilidade passada não representa garantia de rentabilidade futura.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

