      <div style="min-width: 0;">
        <span style="display: inline-block; font-size: 11.5px; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: 0.12em; text-transform: uppercase; color: #1D2F41; background: rgba(74,166,179,0.22); border: 1px solid rgba(74,166,179,0.45); border-radius: 999px; padding: 7px 14px; margin-bottom: 18px;">A gestora</span>
        <h2 style="font-size: clamp(26px, 3vw, 42px); line-height: 1.07; letter-spacing: -0.03em; font-weight: 900; margin: 0 0 16px;">Quem é a Éxes Gestora de Recursos</h2>
        <p style="font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.65; color: #374D61; margin: 0 0 24px; max-width: 54ch;">O EXES11 é gerido pela Éxes Gestora de Recursos, especializada em fundos de crédito privado, fundada por profissionais com mais de 20 anos de mercado financeiro e de capitais brasileiro.</p>
        <div style="display: grid; gap: 12px;">
          <div style="display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 12px; background: #ffffff; border: 1px solid rgba(29,47,65,0.10); border-radius: 18px; padding: 16px 18px;">
            <span style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 26px; height: 26px; border-radius: 999px; background: rgba(74,166,179,0.18); color: #2f7f8a; flex-shrink: 0;">
              <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M20 6L9 17l-5-5"></path></svg>
            </span>
            <p style="font-size: 14.5px; line-height: 1.5; margin: 0; color: #1D2F41;">23 fundos de investimento sob gestão</p>
          </div>
          <div style="display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 12px; background: #ffffff; border: 1px solid rgba(29,47,65,0.10); border-radius: 18px; padding: 16px 18px;">
            <span style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 26px; height: 26px; border-radius: 999px; background: rgba(74,166,179,0.18); color: #2f7f8a; flex-shrink: 0;">
              <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M20 6L9 17l-5-5"></path></svg>
            </span>
            <p style="font-size: 14.5px; line-height: 1.5; margin: 0; color: #1D2F41;">Mais de R$ 2 bilhões em ativos sob gestão (AuM)</p>
          </div>
          <div style="display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 12px; background: #ffffff; border: 1px solid rgba(29,47,65,0.10); border-radius: 18px; padding: 16px 18px;">
            <span style="display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; width: 26px; height: 26px; border-radius: 999px; background: rgba(74,166,179,0.18); color: #2f7f8a; flex-shrink: 0;">
              <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M20 6L9 17l-5-5"></path></svg>
            </span>
            <p style="font-size: 14.5px; line-height: 1.5; margin: 0; color: #1D2F41;">Mais de 20 anos de experiência individual da equipe fundadora</p>
